    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the weight\"... that sounds so peaceful but it also sounds like giving up. but when you say there's no \"next time\", do you mean that it's actually smarter to just stop trying? like, if the math is already decided, why keep pushing against it?",
